### Créer une ressource
POST http://localhost:8000/api/ressources
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "titre": "Documentation MongoDB",
    "url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/",
    "categorieId": 1
}

### Modifier une ressource
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/ressources/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "titre": "Documentation officielle de Symfony",
    "url": "https://symfony.com/doc/current/index.html",
    "categorieId": 1
}